      "topMargin": "5",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Jan 31 2024 16:08:20 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "line1": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Elevating total hip procedures<span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\"> </span></span></h1>\r\n",
      "line2": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><br>\r\n For over 15 years, Mako Total Hip has elevated&nbsp;total hip procedures for patients and surgeons. With the introduction of Mako Total Hip with Advanced Primary and Revision, we’re truly revolutionizing robotic hip replacements.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\">Imagine using the knowledge that comes from a CT-based plan that allows you to capture each patient’s unique anatomy for primary and revision hip procedures.&nbsp;Pair this with Mako’s AccuStop™ haptic technology, which has been shown to help surgeons precisely and accurately single-stage ream what they’ve planned during Mako primary total hip procedures.<sup>1</sup></span></p>\r\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 04 2026 15:51:23 GMT+0000",
